  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fCRAFTER\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Plants_vs_Zombies_plus/BH_Plants_vs_Zombies_plus_header.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"450\"></span></strong></span></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">一款靈感來自《植物大戰殭屍》的 Vanilla+ 模組包，將原版 Minecraft 生存轉變為更沉浸、更危險、更生動的體驗，同時保留原版遊戲的純粹感受。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">利用植物建造防禦工事，抵禦更強大的殭屍浪潮，探索充滿強化氛圍的世界，面對全新敵人和擴展的生存機制。</span></span><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Plants_vs_Zombies_plus/BH_Plants_vs_Zombies_plus_description.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">本模組包結合經典 Minecraft 生存與《植物大戰殭屍》玩法，加入策略性防禦、全新威脅和更多生存方式。</span><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\"><br></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">完整植物與殭屍整合。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">更多敵人種類與危險遭遇。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">沉浸式 Vanilla+ 世界強化。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">平衡的生存核心玩法。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">強化的戰鬥與進程系統。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">擴展的農耕、探索與建造。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">環境氛圍與生活品質提升。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">更動態且具挑戰性的夜晚。</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Plants_vs_Zombies_plus/BH_Plants_vs_Zombies_plus_screenshots.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1686/287/plants-vs-zombies-1.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1686/290/plants-vs-zombies-4.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1686/291/plants-vs-zombies-5.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p><p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">🔥 <strong>立即透過 BisectHosting 在幾分鐘內啟動你的 Minecraft 伺服器！</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fCRAFTER\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Plants_vs_Zombies_plus/BH_Plants_vs_Zombies_plus_promo2.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"250\"></span></strong></span></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">設定自己的伺服器從未如此簡單。<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fCRAFTER\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>BisectHosting</strong></span></a> 提供快速、穩定和 24/7 支援，讓你和朋友順暢遊玩不受干擾。使用優惠碼 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fCRAFTER\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>CRAFTER</strong></span></a> 即可享 75 折優惠，現在就開始打造你的世界吧！</span><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\"><br></span></p>",
